conversation_before_the_call.text:
{
  "message": "I can check your cards now, but I need to verify your identity before I can access any account details. For security, please provide your full name (as on the account) AND any two of the following exactly as they appear on file: (A) date of birth (MM/DD/YYYY), (B) email address, (C) phone number, or (D) physical address. Once you provide those, I’ll check for daily ATM limits, any holds/blocks (including PIN locks or region/international blocks), and whether a temporary ATM-limit increase or other immediate remedy is possible. If you’d rather speak to a human agent right away instead of verifying here, say “transfer me” and I’ll connect you.",
  "notes": [
    "You only need to provide two of the four verification items listed (DOB, email, phone, address).",
    "If you’re uncomfortable sharing verification info in chat, request a transfer and a human agent can assist by phone."
  ],
  "prompt": "Please reply with your full name plus two verification items (e.g., “John Doe, DOB 01/02/1980, phone 555-123-4567”) or say “transfer me”."
}
